'''Mound of Seagrass''' is an {{Epic}} [[Permanent Consumable]] item used to increase the player's max {{Stat|pressure resistance}}.

== Obtaining ==
=== Mob Drops ===
{{Drop Sources}}

== Usage ==
Up to {{Green|5}} '''Mound of Seagrass''' can be consumed to permanently gain {{Stat|pressure resistance|+1}} and {{SBXP|2}}.

